=== layout: one-panel

# Your First Two Decisions

@body

- Form a working group of 3-4 students on Nov 12.
- Select one company proposal on Nov 19.
- Choose one of the individual proposals and develop it as a group.
- Decide what the company will make, who needs it, and what biotechnology makes it plausible.
- Revise early when new people, evidence, and expertise make the original idea stronger.

