=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- Form your group November 12 and choose its project November 19.
- Build one shared scientific and business case, with meaningful work from every member.
- Follow the presentation requirements and the business-plan section order.
- Present December 10; submit the complete plan December 17.

